Based on connect4-alphazero by Eugene Peng:
https://github.com/eugeneyp/connect4-alphazero
Source snapshot: a936aadd74a6a6dd9035e576b89aeb5a3ea7ef73

The inherited game engine, neural network, MCTS, training framework,
configuration, agents, and supporting scripts retain the upstream MIT license.
The pretrained reference checkpoint models/large.pt also comes from that project.

This repository adds the bounded fine-tuning experiments, saved iteration-2
self-play data and checkpoint, training and export checks, standalone inference
improvements, actual-archive comparisons, and their recorded results.
